This looks like a bug in the Heck 1d patch to me; the patch adds (like
you said) one extra variant for the sanctum, so it has to change the
filename to "sanctm".  Unfortunately this makes the Is_sanctum() check
to fail, because it still checks against the old "sanctum" filename.

This causes the door to the sanctum temple in the original level
variant never to be generated.


To fix this, change the following line in dungeon.c:

{ "sanctum",    &sanctum_level },

to

{ "sanctm",    &sanctum_level },

and recompile.


Unfortunately this doesn't help your character who already made it
down there...


